WEBVTT

NOTE
Aftermath of the assassination attempt. Irvine at his sniper position, street riots erupt, a car flees the presidential residence.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Irvine crouches behind the rooftop parapet. The clock tower reads twenty hundred hours.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
In the streets below, a brawl erupts. Soldiers and civilians clash amid the chaos.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
A sleek vintage car races through the dark streets, fleeing the scene.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The car speeds away from the presidential residence, taillights glowing red.
